sparky-stereo-headset 0.1.0 (2026-11-18)
  * First release (ORDER 696): the Headset page of System Settings (Multimedia, beside Sound), the Headset entry of the panel and a user service, over HeadsetControl.
  * The page shows only what the connected headset reports (battery, sidetone, lights, voice prompts, inactive time, equalizer presets, chat mix); with no headset it says so.
  * Choices are kept in ~/.config/sparky-stereo-headsetrc (KConfig), only for what was changed, and sent again when the same headset is plugged in again.
  * The panel entry is in the tray only while a headset is connected; its menu holds the settings page, lights, voice prompts, sidetone and the equalizer presets the headset has.
  * Ten languages.
